# Don't build or test

Never run builds or tests. Alexis does that part.

Do not invoke `xcodebuild`, `swift test`, `swift build`, Xcode, simulators, or any other compile/test command unless he explicitly asks you to run one.

Writing or editing test code is fine when the task calls for it. Running those tests is not.
